// Source hash: md5:a12b693254200ac8bfac3476f7f4b897
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_real_R)
Theorem SQRT_INV : forall x :e R, (if 0 <= recip_SNo x then sqrt_SNo_nonneg (recip_SNo x) else - sqrt_SNo_nonneg (- recip_SNo x)) = recip_SNo (if 0 <= x then sqrt_SNo_nonneg x else - sqrt_SNo_nonneg (- x)).
Admitted.

