// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_num_omega, hol_real_R, omega_Subq_R)
Theorem SQRT_EQ_0 : forall x :e R, (if 0 <= x then sqrt_SNo_nonneg x else - sqrt_SNo_nonneg (- x)) = 0 <-> x = 0.
Admitted.

