// HOL Light: real.ml:1898 / SQRT_INJ
// Source hash: md5:5daccc42c789bcc1fcc7b1e7f597cf3a
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_real_R)
Theorem SQRT_INJ : forall x y :e R, (if 0 <= x then sqrt_SNo_nonneg x else - sqrt_SNo_nonneg (- x)) = (if 0 <= y then sqrt_SNo_nonneg y else - sqrt_SNo_nonneg (- y)) <-> x = y.
Admitted.

